    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Thanks for your reply Huidong. I have one more query, if you can help me out.<a href=\"https://plus.google.com/u/0/118329399680451916519?prsrc=4\" style=\"color:rgb(66,127,237);font-size:24px;vertical-align:middle;font-family:&#39;normal arial&#39;,sans-serif;text-align:center\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://plus.google.com/u/0/118329399680451916519?prsrc%3D4&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792394043582000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3tsjvz6c0VnJXWOnfCisDf\"><span style=\"vertical-align:baseline\"><br></span></a>Is there any way to customise the path of the &quot;www/shared&quot; Folder in RStudio.</div><div>Can I have a directory structure like &quot;www/xyz/shared&quot;? </div></div>"
    ],
    [
